Job Description:
- Perform tasks to compile accounting data; Closely monitor all journal entries within the accounting system in accordance with Tax and Accounting laws;
- Check all journal entries on the accounting system, including income and expense entries, classification, and make corrections if necessary;
- Prepare journal entries for depreciation of fixed assets, prepaid expenses, provisions, etc., to support monthly financial reporting;
- Generate monthly and annual financial reports;
- Explain data and provide documentation to tax authorities and auditors;
- Carry out other tasks as assigned by superiors.

Requirements:
- Bachelor's degree or higher in Finance, Accounting, or related fields;
- Minimum of 3 years of relevant work experience;
- Proficient in using SAP accounting software;
- Good knowledge of accounting systems and standards, skilled in preparing financial reports;
- Ability to handle work pressure well;
- Willingness to travel regularly as required by the company.

Benefits:
- Competitive salary with meal allowances and other benefits;
- 13th-month salary and year-end bonuses based on performance;
- Monthly business performance bonuses;
- Full insurance coverage including health insurance under Suncare;
- Special discounts on services at entertainment facilities for employees and their families;
- Continuous professional training opportunities;
- "An cư lạc nghiệp" policy - provision of commercial apartments (100% value) for long-serving staff.

Keywords: accounting, finance, tax, auditing, risk management, cashier, financial advisor

Job Description 
- Mix drinks for customers according to the company's regulations; 
- Be well-versed in basic drink recipes and menu items; proficient in mixing demonstration skills and serving manners;
- Responsible for receiving, preparing, and replenishing supplies; arranging and mixing various types of beverages based on customer requests;
- Ensure the quality and quantity of drinks and supplies served at the counter during shifts or when assigned tasks;
- Maintain cleanliness of the bar counter, common areas, and ensure food safety regarding beverages at work;
- Be ready to answer and address any customer inquiries with a friendly, attentive, courteous, and considerate attitude;
- Carry out other tasks as required by management.

Requirements
- No formal education requirement; having attended training or holding certification is an advantage;
- At least one year of experience in mixing drinks;
- Excellent communication skills, adept at handling situations flexibly and skillfully;
- Able to work on holidays and festivals.

Benefits
- Competitive salary with meal allowances and other support;
- 13th-month salary and end-of-year bonuses based on performance;
- Monthly service charge bonus;
- Full insurance coverage including SunCare health insurance benefits;
- Special discounts when using services at entertainment areas for themselves and their families as per employee policies;
- Continuous professional training;
- "Settling down and thriving" policy - providing commercial housing (100% value) for long-term employees.

Keywords: accounting, accountant, internal auditor, risk management specialist, cashier, financial advisor

Job Description

Job Responsibilities:
- Receive, inspect, and distribute goods according to orders;
- Move, arrange, and classify goods in the warehouse;
- Ensure quality standards and cleanliness during work;
- Assist with inventory checks and ensure compliance with regulations;
- Collaborate effectively in a team, adhere to warehouse rules and discipline.

Working Time and Location:
- Work hours: 8 hours/day, 6 days/week. Rest days are scheduled by management. Overtime is available based on registration.
- Shifts (rotating shifts as arranged by Management):
  - Cold storage: 08:00-17:00 / 09:00-18:00 / 14:00-23:00
  - Regular warehouse: 07:15-16:15 / 08:15-17:15 / 09:00-18:00 / 09:45-18:45
- Work location: BW Warehouse, Lot D2, Tan Phu Trung Industrial Zone - Cu Chi

Income:
- Basic Salary (full insurance coverage): 5,400,000 VND/month
- Overtime Pay: 1,664,000 VND/month
- Meal allowance and transportation subsidy: 1,200,000 VND/month
- Environmental temperature allowance: 260,000 - 780,000 VND/month
- Additional bonuses:
  - Integration bonus: 500,000 VND (after one month of employment)
  - Accompanying bonus: 1,000,000 - 1,500,000 VND (after 3-6 months and commitment to work with the company)

Other Benefits for Full-Time Employees:
- Monthly salary, bonuses, and allowances;
- Year-end bonus, business performance bonus;
- Annual salary review twice a year;
- Social insurance, accident insurance, health insurance;
- Bi-annual health check-ups;
- Stable, youthful, dynamic working environment with many development opportunities.

Requirements:

- Age: 18 to 28 years old (male or female);
- Good health, able to handle tasks requiring frequent movement and travel;
- Basic calculation skills;
- Honest, quick-witted, careful, diligent, and responsible;
- Disciplined, cooperative, and good at teamwork.

