Job Description:
- Proactively seek out, market to new customers, sell products, and maintain regular relationships with clients.
- Receive and resolve customer issues and needs.
- Carry out cross-selling of VietinBank’s product services.
- Conduct preliminary assessment of loan applications and recommend credit approval for customers.
- Collect on both overdue and non-performing loans; manage customer information.
- Conduct pre-loan, during-loan, and post-loan checks, urge customers to repay loans on time, coordinate with the handling and recovery of bad debts and risk-managed debts of assigned customers.
- Manage customer information, update customer data for relevant departments to provide early warning services.

